# ROUTER ENGINE: INTENT CLASSIFICATION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Takes the raw user input and returns a tuple:
#     (kind, text, topic)
#
# kind is one of: greeting, thanks, apology, fact, council, weather,
#                 math, local, joke, compliment, recommend, opinion,
#                 planning, statement, sys_check, etc.
#
